0f1-5d9b7cc6698c" :question/math-academy-id "q-82088" :question/problem "Which of the following statements are true?\n- **I.** **If** $7$ is divisible by $2$, **then** $8$ is divisible by $4.$\n- **II.** **If** $8$ is divisible by $4$, **then** $7$ is divisible by $2.$\n- **III.** **If** $7$ is divisible by $4$, **then** $8$ is divisible by $2.$\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "An implication $A⇒B$ is true *unless* $A$ is true and $B$ is false. In other words, the implication is true unless the \"promise\" is broken.\n\n- Statement I is true. The antecedent \"$7$ is divisible by $2$\" is false, so the promise does not apply. Regardless of the consequent, the promise is *not* broken, and the statement is true.\n\n- Statement II is false. The antecedent \"$8$ is divisible by $4$\" is true, and the consequent \"$7$ is divisible by $2$\" is false. So the promise is broken, and the statement is false.\n\n- Statement III is true. Again, the antecedent \"$7$ is divisible by $4$ is false, so the promise does not apply. Regardless of the consequent, the promise is *not* broken, and the statement is true.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186377879 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059701 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "64a3922f-7e74-562f-9bb9-c4a41e912ce7" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying True Conditional Statements" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050360 :topic/id #uuid "4264930a-5f20-54f0-ad2a-c3ad45c03658" :topic/math-academy-id 250 :topic/title "Conditional Statements"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9a8a6673-8f91-545f-8a4d-69610e6a65c6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471699} {:answer/id #uuid "be843573-06a8-5b94-9213-a54267611785" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/te